OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine, then clear spells
OL,7,Fafter dark. Turning cloudier from the
OL,8,Fsoutheast overnight though, with
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain arriving through the
OL,10,Fearly hours, perhaps with some heavier
OL,11,Fbursts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA cloudy start to the new week
OL,14,Fwith patchy outbreaks of rain. These
OL,15,Fgradually clear, with skies turning
OL,16,Fbrighter through the morning, and some
OL,17,Fsunny spells developing for the
OL,18,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
