OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FUnsettled through Tuesday and
OL,7,FWednesday with cloudy skies, patchy
OL,8,Frain and a breeze at times. Some
OL,9,Fbrighter spells on Thursday, but with
OL,10,Fa few showers still possible. Turning
OL,11,Fwindy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
